Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.63,0:02:30.67,SC23 Map Saudi Arabia,map right,0,0,0,,{\frz-14.45\fscx824.86\fscy824.86\pos(1949.64,-76.88)}Saudi Arabia
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its general lack of pollution\Nand inflowing river water
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,makes it one of the most immaculate\Nbodies of water on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you can\Ndrive this thing, Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a problem\Nwhatsoever, Polnareff. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Avdol's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let you put\Nus through another crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you sure seem to\Nbe in a foul mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, I'm a bit surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lot more spacious than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rich folks typically use vessels\Nlike these when they want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get away for a while and\Nexplore the seafloor for pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, it even has windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's génial!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, come to think of it, I've\Nalways sort of liked this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I wish I could have\Nridden in one with a cute girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, you haven't\Nchanged, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now could you please try just\Nonce to take this seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is sonar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It uses reflective sound waves to detect\Nunderwater objects, much like radar. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not picking up\Nanything in our vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this machine, we can detect\Nanyone trying to attack us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter which direction the\Nenemy decides to come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if someone did attack us in here,\NThere'd be nowhere for us to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be like trapped rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,60 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sub is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess it is a pleasure\Ncruiser for the wealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has a refrigerator,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a coffee maker, and it's even equipped\Nwith the latest in satellite phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kick! I should call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind getting me\Na drink while you're up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying of thirst here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take one too. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Cola okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, why are you just standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something bugging you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, I need you to give\Nme a moment's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered I have\Na phone call to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A phone call? To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would you need to call from a\Nsubmarine in the middle of the Red Sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone important, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might even call it a delicate matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, as I said, I need you all to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, heavens me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one should I pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:05:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between the two, the sparkly\Ndesign is much more to my liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But is it appropriate for\Nthe charity event tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a refreshing\Nwhite would be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of the gowns look\Nlovely on you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joseph, darling, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where are you calling from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bit hard to hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but I have to attend\Nsome unexpected business that's come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be difficult traveling on business
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to another country right\Nafter going to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been nearly a month, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it has. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Susie, have\Nyou spoken to Holly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I spoke to her\Non the phone yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She mentioned catching a cold that's\Ndeveloped into a bout of pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She tried convincing me\Nthat it wasn't serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm thinking about going to visit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.15,0:06:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive she'll recover quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is what he meant\Nby a delicate matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Joestar is still as\Neffervescent as someone half her age,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he checks in now and again to ensure\Nshe doesn't visit Miss Holly in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way she's protected from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that she... I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hasn't been told anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to\Nworry her unnecessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.22,0:06:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hold off on going to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I have you on the line,\Nthere's something I need to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having a hard time deciding whether I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should wear the white\Ndress or the purple one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Susie, I need to speak to Roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you pass the phone to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam, have you considered wearing\Nyour blue dress to the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly, it's\Nin the back of the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go and have a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Master Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Anne. Where's Susie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She left the room, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no chance of her\Noverhearing our conversation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually calling from the submarine\Nthat the two of us spoke of a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I take it you were successful\Nin reuniting with Master Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, tell me about Holly's condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely by now you've gotten hold of the\Ndoctors from the Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, when speaking\Nto her mother on the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Holly says that her illness\Nis nothing more than a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's quite insistent that\Nthere's no cause for alarm,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but her condition worsens by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Joseph,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think the time has finally\Ncome to tell Madame Joestar the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:07:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to get her riled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to put an end\Nto all this very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want Holly to go back to her normal\Nlife and never know about any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't inform my wife of what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under no circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is what you wish, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pray for your safe return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.49,0:08:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hang up the phone already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't finished talking to him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we have some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will join me for a cup, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Oh please madam Allow me to\Nserve the tea for you Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you have to do that. Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can rest easy, because\Nwe're right here behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be in Egypt before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must defeat Dio as soon as we can,\Nand save Miss Holly from his curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have returned from the\Nbrink, for this very reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you guys. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, driving this is actually pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's how you were\Nmaking it look so simple, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Pete's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get so carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, the sea has\Nits fair share of rough terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's speed\Nthis tub up a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goldoraf, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eww, I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me when we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's exactly five cups in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.93,0:09:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and make the coffee, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want some now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you make it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just spotted the coast of Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seawater has worn away\Nthe rocks and carved
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out an underwater tunnel\Nnear this coral reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exit is 200 meters inland, which makes\Nthis the perfect spot for us to surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, we finally\Nmade it. Wolf, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.94,0:10:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what's so funny nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just feeling sort of happy is all It's\Nbeen quite a while since the five of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all gathered together like this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:11:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, talk you in why'd you\Ngrab six cups for five people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I didn't notice I\Ncould have sworn it was five
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man! Mr. Joestar!
